<p>Teero ke musalle par wo sajdae shukraana<br />
Shabbir ne sikhlaaya islaam pe marjaana</p>

<p>Kuch is tarah laash aayi ek raat ke byaahe ki<br />
afsos ke maadar ne bete ko na pehchaana </p>

<p>
Barchi ali akber ke seene se nikal aayi<br />
dekha na gaya sheh se yu'n dil ka nikal aana</p>

<p>Ye maa ki wasiyyat thi abbase dilaawar ko<br />
Jab deen pa ban aaye tum jaan fida karna</p>

<p>Laashe ali akber ko hatho'n pa utha bole<br />
haazir hai mere allah shabbir ka nazraana</p>

<p>Soncho to musalmaano ye baat koi kam hai<br />
Ahmad ki nawaasi ka darbaar me aa jaana</p>

<p>saidaaniyo ka us waqt kya haal hua hoga<br />
masoom ka ro ro kar zindaan me mar jaana</p>

<p>Ek teer ali asghar ki gardan pe laga aakar<br />
Masoom ka has dena aur mout ka ghabraana</p>